    <string name="about">
        Bridge Talent Management is a Kenyan-based recruitment and employee outsourcing company committed to connecting
        businesses with the right talent. We specialize in providing efficient, accessible, and technology-driven staffing
        solutions tailored to Kenya’s dynamic and evolving labour market.\n\n
        Founded in Nairobi, Bridge Talent began by supporting small businesses and start-ups with
        candidate sourcing and screening. Through this work, we identified a major gap in how job
        opportunities were accessed, coordinated, and shared with job seekers. This insight shaped our
        mission to build a more structured, transparent, and inclusive recruitment process.
    </string>


